<title>UK: Next UK monetary meetings on Dec 11, January 15.</title>
<headline>Next UK monetary meetings on Dec 11, January 15.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The next two monetary meetings between Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke and Bank of England Governor Eddie George will be on December 11 and January 15, the Treasury said.</p>
</text>
